# Never copy local secrets, personal data or environments into the image.
# Patterns without **/ only match at the top level of the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/signatures/
**/artist_signatures/
user_data/
db/
logs/
email.html
.venv/
venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.import_linter_cache/
test/
